      "package": "@modelcontextprotocol/server-postgres",
      "version": "0.6.2",
      "registry": "https://registry.npmjs.org/",
      "versionMatchesServerInfo": false,
      "reconciliation": "metadata.serverInfo.version is 0.1.0, the server's internal version. CHANGELOG.md is explicit: 'Captured the single query tool from @modelcontextprotocol/server-postgres 0.6.2 (server version 0.1.0)'. Note that 0.1.0 also exists on npm, so pinning to serverInfo.version would have silently resolved to the wrong package."
    }
  },
